# ============================================================
# Plugin — Experimental plugin routes
# Docs: https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/api
# ============================================================


### List plugins
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/plugin

### Wait for plugin activation
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/plugin/await
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Check plugin updates
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/plugin/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target": "opencode"
}

### Update plugins
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/plugin/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targets": ["opencode"]
}
